[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824748657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642#issuecomment-3824748657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642","id":3824748657,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j-Qhx","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T17:03:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:07:02Z","body":"> Benchmark: Synthetic testing (100k emissions) showed a ~2.3x speedup (reduced overhead from ~14.7ms to ~6.3ms).\r\n\r\nPlease provide the testing context, synthetic testing doesn't represent the actual performance in real runtime cases, the fact that this speeds up emission is not in question, it should result in measurable improvements in real world testing\r\n\r\nWhat real world peformance issues did you face to base this on? As mentioned on your previous attempt, we shouldn't just grab areas of the engine that *might* benefit from optimization","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824748657/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824804445","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642#issuecomment-3824804445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642","id":3824804445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j-eJd","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T17:17:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:18:21Z","body":"Thanks for the quick review!\r\n\r\nI see your point regarding the Tree signal—that was purely for consistency with the rest of the file, but I can revert it.\r\n\r\nregarding the AnimatedSprites: The mentorship is much appreciated 😊. My reasoning for targeting animation_looped specifically is that while it's not a 'every frame' signal for a single sprite, it becomes significant in scenarios with high instance counts (e.g., hundreds of looping bullet effects or particle-like animated sprites).\r\n\r\nSince frame_changed and animation_finished in the same _notification block already use SceneStringName()/optimized paths, animation_looped stood out as the unoptimized outlier in that runtime logic. (Regarding the scene/2d/animated_sprite_2d.cpp, It might've been an overlook on my part for not testing this specifically as I simply noticed the similarity in code structure between the 3D and 2D animation loops and judged the logic might work.)\r\n\r\nI can try to set up a stress test with 500-1000 looping sprite instances to see if the frame time delta is measurable, or I can revert the changes if it seems unnecessary?\r\n\r\nThank you!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824804445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824811112","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642#issuecomment-3824811112","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642","id":3824811112,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j-fxo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T17:19:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:20:27Z","body":"I'd say the only change in this that might make sense is the animation, but I doubt that one too, user input is never gonna be a hot path for this purpose, it won't happen a lot in parallel, or a lot of times per frame, so `Tree` doesn't make sense to change here at all I'd say\r\n\r\nBut I'd say the looped signal is left out *by design* because it doesn't represent a bottleneck, compared with anything else in that path, though no others in that notification use `SNAME`, the scene string names are very different","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824811112/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824819301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642#issuecomment-3824819301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642","id":3824819301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j-hxl","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T17:22:01Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:22:01Z","body":"But in all honesty I'd suggest doing something *other* than trying to do optimization, it's a pretty specialized thing and requires a lot of experience to do right, it's not something suited to relatively inexperienced contributors, so I'd say you should focus on something else until you've got more experience and understand the engine internals better","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824819301/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824852787","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642#issuecomment-3824852787","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642","id":3824852787,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j-p8z","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T17:31:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:31:21Z","body":"Thanks for the honest feedback @AThousandShips.\r\n\r\nI appreciate the advice. You're right— I was diving into optimization without fully grasping the engine's deeper architectural intent (like the nuances of SceneStringName vs SNAME until I learned about them recently). I'll consider this PR and my previous attempt as learning moments; I'm not leaving empty-handed, as I've gained some valuable insight into how optimization works in Godot.\r\n\r\nI'll take your suggestion to heart and pivot to bug fixing or implementing features to build up that internal knowledge first. I hope to return with enough experience to contribute deeper changes in the future. 😊\r\n\r\nClosing this PR to avoid noise. Thanks for the review!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824852787/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824857265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642#issuecomment-3824857265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642","id":3824857265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j-rCx","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com